# serde-json-schema

This repo implements an outdated draft of json-schema. On this branch we're trying to upgrade to version 2020-12.

The work is in progress and needs validation and refinement.

We are migrating from draft 7 to 2020-12

## Migration from older drafts

### Details for migrations from Draft-07 to 2019-09.
<https://json-schema.org/draft/2019-09/release-notes>

### Draft 2019-09 to Draft 2020-12
<https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/release-notes>

### Notes on the current draft 2020-12
<https://json-schema.org/understanding-json-schema/reference>
<https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema>
<https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/draft-bhutton-json-schema-validation-01>

